> Privacy Regulations Covered
* GDPR Compliance: EU General Data Protection Regulation — cookie consent with opt-in, legitimate interest basis configuration, DSAR handling, and data processing records
* CCPA / CPRA Compliance: California Consumer Privacy Act and California Privacy Rights Act — "Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information" link, opt-out mechanism, and consumer request handling
* LGPD Compliance: Brazil's Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados — Portuguese-language banners, consent basis management, and ANPD-aligned cookie categories
* PIPEDA Compliance: Canada's Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act — bilingual English/French consent banners with implied consent model
* PDPA Compliance: Thailand's Personal Data Protection Act — Thai-language consent interface, data controller notification, and purpose-based consent collection
* APPI Compliance: Japan's Act on the Protection of Personal Information — Japanese-language consent banner with opt-out provisions for third-party data sharing
* POPIA Compliance: South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act — consent management aligned with POPIA platforms for lawful processing
* NZPA Compliance: New Zealand Privacy Act 2020 — information privacy principles implementation with cross-border transfer controls
* DPDPA Compliance: India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act — consent notices and data principal rights implementation
* FADP / nDSG Compliance: Switzerland's Federal Act on Data Protection — Swiss-specific consent requirements separate from EU GDPR
* UK GDPR Compliance: United Kingdom's post-Brexit GDPR implementation — ICO-aligned cookie consent with UK-specific data transfer provisions
* Quebec Law 25 Compliance: Quebec's privacy modernization law — French-language consent management with privacy officer designation support
* TDPSA Compliance: Texas Data Privacy and Security Act — opt-out consent model with universal opt-out mechanism recognition
* Additional Regulations: Virginia VCDPA, Colorado CPA, Connecticut CTDPA, Oregon OCPA, Montana MCDPA, Delaware DPDPA, Iowa ICDPA, Tennessee TIPA, Indiana ICDPA, and 20+ more US state and international privacy laws
* EAA Compliance: European Accessibility Act — web accessibility requirements for e-commerce stores selling to EU consumers, effective June 2025
